        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.505,
            0.562,
            0.924,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": "fire）结合-ptosis 词根组合，命名为 “pyroptosis”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.507,
            0.589,
            0.77,
            0.607
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "15.2.2.2 细胞凋亡的形态特征"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.506,
            0.619,
            0.937,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "细胞凋亡具有明显的形态学特征，包括:细胞变圆，染色质凝缩、分块，胞质皱缩（图 15-7）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.369,
            0.67,
            0.629,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
